{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命理分析，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，需木火帮扶。年柱、时柱辛丑金土耗火，月柱庚子金水更增寒湿。日支酉金为偏财，代表妻子星，但酉金被月支子水所泄，且丁火坐偏财，婚姻宫受克，早年感情易波折。\n\n大运排布中，27-36岁行丁酉运，比肩帮身，但酉金伏吟日支，婚姻宫动，此运有婚缘机会。37-46岁丙申运，劫财透干，申子半合水局，财星被合，感情压力大。47岁后乙未运，未土冲丑，但未为木库，印星生身，婚姻趋于稳定。\n\n综合来看，命主在27-36岁（丁酉运）期间，日主得比肩助力，且婚姻宫伏吟，最有可能成婚。选项A（23-32岁）覆盖此运前半段，符合传统婚龄，且丁火得比肩帮扶，财星（妻星）虽弱但可受生，故推断在此阶段结婚。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3848, "response_id": "3581585a-979f-409d-97ae-53e40d637086", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 401, "completion_tokens": 268, "total_tokens": 669, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 17}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水势力强，火势衰微。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水成势，丁火被重重克泄，属于身弱格局。命局中官杀（水）极旺，且金生水，官杀攻身，容易有官非、刑狱之象。\n\n大运方面，早年己亥、戊戌运，土能制水，尚可；但进入丁酉、丙申运，金旺生水，官杀更旺，且丙丁火比劫帮身有限，申酉金又为财星生官杀，此阶段（约27-46岁）官非风险最高。其中丙申运（37-46岁，1998-2007年）申金合子水，水势更旺，且丙火被申金截脚，帮身无力，此运中官非刑事最易爆发。\n\n选项对应年龄：C选项33-42岁正好落在丙申运内（37-42岁），且此运中申子辰合水局（原局有子、丑，遇申则合），官杀力量达到顶峰，故最符合。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4055, "response_id": "57742c3f-bfc1-4ec3-a426-bb1b278e0dbe", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 407, "completion_tokens": 276, "total_tokens": 683, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 23}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q14", "domain": "unknown", "question": "有凶劫之灾出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱辛丑，月柱庚子，日柱丁酉，时柱辛丑。日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水势强，丁火无根，属于身弱极需帮扶之命。早年大运为己亥（7岁起），但问题中提到的流年都在大运之前或初期。\n\n分析各流年：\n- 1965年乙巳：乙木偏印生丁火，巳火为日主之根，但巳火被月支子水冲克，且年柱辛丑、时柱辛丑金湿土晦火，虽有生扶但根基不稳，但尚不至于大凶。\n- 1968年戊申：此年进入己亥大运（7岁起），流年戊申，申金与月支子水半合水局，加重水势，丁火更弱，且戊土伤官泄火生金，凶险程度较高。\n- 1971年辛亥：流年辛金偏财透出，亥水冲巳（原局无巳，但亥与月支子水会水局），水势更旺，丁火被克泄交加，但亥中甲木暗生火，略有救应。\n- 1974年甲寅：甲木正印透干，寅木为丁火之长生，且寅木与月支子水相生，但木能化水生火，此年反而有救，非凶。\n\n综合比较，1968年戊申，申子半合水局，水势最旺，丁火几乎被灭，且大运初交，运势动荡，凶劫之灾最明显。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6fbdcedb130f902d280faa5ed3bd785b4042c3080e46ea9c87e9c8395734596e", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q14", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4901, "response_id": "408abe84-bb7f-4292-ab34-175e3b80436c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 470, "completion_tokens": 371, "total_tokens": 841, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "female_19831028_P004-Q17", "domain": "relationship", "question": "第一段婚姻是何时嫁？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于戌月，土旺。年柱癸亥、月柱壬戌，水旺财星透干，但日主身强，喜财官。女命以官杀为夫星，原局中月干壬水为正财，时支巳火藏庚金伤官，夫星（甲木正官）不显，需大运流年引动。\n\n大运排布：13-22岁行甲子运（正官），此运为婚恋关键期。2003年癸未，流年癸水偏财，未土为比肩，财旺但无官星引动，且未土与日支丑土相冲，感情不稳，非婚期。2005年乙酉，流年乙木七杀透出，酉金为食神，乙木七杀与日主相合（乙庚合，但日主为己，乙木克己土为七杀），且酉金与日支丑土半合金局，食神制杀，有婚象，但七杀为偏夫，需看大运甲木正官是否引动。2005年正值甲子运中，甲木正官透出，流年乙木七杀，官杀混杂，但大运甲木正官有力，流年乙木为辅助，且酉金为桃花，此年婚动可能性大。2007年丁亥，丁火偏印，亥水正财，亥水与日支丑土拱合，但无官星，婚缘不显。2009年己丑，比肩重重，土旺克水，财星受损，且无官星，非婚期。\n\n综合判断，2005年乙酉年，大运正官，流年七杀，官杀并见，且酉金为桃花，符合女命婚期特征，故第一段婚姻应在2005年。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "6dce3752dc71c1ff036ec757bd56344367aec6d621cb801c4b22fd5bbd5e41a0", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19831028_P004-Q17", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5135, "response_id": "391fc33e-b098-4f52-b4f7-89cbe41b01ab", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 458, "completion_tokens": 424, "total_tokens": 882, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 74}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_