{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q21", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主在哪一年登记结婚？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于辰月，伤官旺而身偏弱，喜木火帮扶。婚姻宫为卯木偏印，配偶星为壬水正官（藏于月支辰中）和癸水七杀（时支申中藏壬水）。命局中正官星壬水透于月干，但被年干辛金偏财所生，且坐辰土伤官，官星受制，婚姻易有波折。\n\n大运方面，命主在1992年起行己丑食神大运，食神制杀，感情上较为挑剔或晚成。1998年戊寅，流年伤官透干，地支寅木生火，但伤官见官（流年寅与月支辰中壬水官星无直接作用），且寅申冲（时支申金被冲），婚姻宫卯木被寅木合绊，感情不稳定，非婚动之象。1999年己卯，流年食神透出，地支卯木为婚姻宫伏吟，且卯辰相害，虽有情缘但易生矛盾，非最佳婚期。\n\n2002年壬午，流年正官壬水透出，与月干壬水并见，官星力量增强，且午火为日主之禄，身转旺能任官，午与婚姻宫卯木半合（卯午破，但午火生卯木），有婚动之象。2003年癸未，七杀透干，地支未土与婚姻宫卯木半合木局（卯未半合），但未为燥土，合中带克，且七杀为偏夫，不如正官稳定。\n\n综合来看，2002年正官透干且日主得禄，是婚缘最明显的一年，故选择C。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "30642022bceaf29b0df5c7658859abd121d152d17c228cf1f7efd31c2ce63d23", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19710412_P005-Q21", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5606, "response_id": "ee908e74-1e8b-4104-9751-2492024acf7d", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 457, "completion_tokens": 403, "total_tokens": 860, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 73}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disa